main.py

^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Exception handling inside functions: raise inside a function called
from a try block doesn't properly propagate to the caller's except
handler. The __exception_active flag is set but the function returns
a default value instead of transferring control to the handler.
Affects ~19 ESBMC tests.
